{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.10897007554972149,"w":0.053534024556477849,"c":1,"t":"Test 3","h":0.011711011646212355,"x":0.20985850202224252},{"c":1,"t":"Questions 32-36","y":0.14958775028562532,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.2098765449921873,"w":0.15432098388671875},{"h":0.019743656522393627,"y":0.18015561347638864,"x":0.20766472427255242,"w":0.71221562703450514,"c":1,"t":"Do the following statements agree with the claims of the writer in Reading Passage 3?"},{"h":0.019695549325752126,"t":"In boxes 32-36 on your answer sheet, write","c":1,"x":0.20755280452165153,"y":0.21045794757268332,"w":0.36261571248372398},{"t":"YES","w":0.037037035624186199,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.27160493864881224,"y":0.24127906951907419,"c":1},{"w":0.030864197413126626,"c":1,"y":0.2572674416925983,"t":"NO","x":0.2695473250588688,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"x":0.38874127209656562,"w":0.42617523193359375,"t":"if the statement agrees with the claims of the writer","y":0.24260051317786169,"h":0.017628627053699941},{"t":"if the statement contradicts the claims of the writer","c":1,"w":0.41996195475260423,"x":0.38878347251125878,"h":0.015436263471947154,"y":0.25838062771115577},{"y":0.27236571899647177,"w":0.57855387369791655,"h":0.020195322969074891,"t":"NOT GIVEN if it is impossible to say what the writer thinks about this","x":0.26933875690015358,"c":1},{"w":0.32970387776692711,"y":0.31033109450862117,"h":0.016855291539563999,"t":"32 Children need toys in order to play.","x":0.20758199681760137,"c":1},{"x":0.20553816638926775,"w":0.62390747070312491,"t":"33 It is a mistake to treat play and learning as separate types of activities.","h":0.020789365465143872,"y":0.3339432622359757,"c":1},{"h":0.018211049101237498,"c":1,"y":0.35858439034105816,"x":0.20555260344953921,"t":"34 Play helps children to develop their artistic talents.","w":0.45723317464192714},{"y":0.38282558395687682,"t":"35 Researchers have agreed on a definition of play.","w":0.43859359741210935,"x":0.20767283340311934,"h":0.01569447500545651,"c":1},{"t":"36 Work and play differ in terms of whether or not they have a target.","c":1,"w":0.5826781717936198,"h":0.01753300407328795,"y":0.40651349528933389,"x":0.20763909364381797},{"x":0.19958847746006245,"y":0.86482558123800246,"w":0.024691357612609877,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"70"}]}